X faces backlash for AI-generated deepfakes
  URL: https://dvhsnews.org/6487/science-technology/x-faces-backlash-for-ai-generated-deepfakes/
  Social media platform X (formerly known as Twitter) has been the center of recent controversy surrounding the platform's AI chatbot Grok.

